hints = PackedStringArray("Two things in this room were written for you: the words over the door, and Wren\'s chalk on the plinth.", "The door says the moment is to be sent, not kept. Wren\'s chalk is a sentence: a star, a line from it, straight up, on and on.", "Light, Beam, Up, Long sends the held moment away. (Ice, Freeze, Self, Large keeps it, for ever.)")
